    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Shenaniganza?</h2><br><strong>Shenaniganza is a videogame interpretation and remake of the real world game &quot;manhunt&quot;. Manhunt is alike hide-and-seek, but with a thrilling twist. The Hiders become seekers! In the game you will find wacky powerups and silly skins that let you express your inner silly Billy!</strong><br><br><strong>Abilities</strong><br>In Shenaniganza, there are several abilities, deploy a heat seeking monkey to find the seekers or weaponize the local banana supply and stun the seekers!<br><br><strong>Map Features</strong><br>Across the map you will find portals and other interactable mobility objects such as cannons. Use these to escape sticky situations and throw the seekers off course!<br><br><strong>Matchmaking</strong><br>Shenaniganza features a lobby based matchmaking system, you can either join private games through codes supplied by the game upon lobby creation, or you can choose to quick join a game / choose a public lobby from the lobby selection screen.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Shenaniganza?</h2><br><strong>Shenaniganza is a videogame interpretation and remake of the real world game &quot;manhunt&quot;. Manhunt is alike hide-and-seek, but with a thrilling twist. The Hiders become seekers! In the game you will find wacky powerups and silly skins that let you express your inner silly Billy!</strong><br><br><strong>Abilities</strong><br>In Shenaniganza, there are several abilities, deploy a heat seeking monkey to find the seekers or weaponize the local banana supply and stun the seekers!<br><br><strong>Map Features</strong><br>Across the map you will find portals and other interactable mobility objects such as cannons. Use these to escape sticky situations and throw the seekers off course!<br><br><strong>Matchmaking</strong><br>Shenaniganza features a lobby based matchmaking system, you can either join private games through codes supplied by the game upon lobby creation, or you can choose to quick join a game / choose a public lobby from the lobby selection screen.",
    "short_description": "Outsmart friends in goofy hide-and-seek with crazy power-ups, vibrant cartoon aesthetics, and endless laughter. Form alliances, betray buddies, and experience multiplayer mayhem in this unpredictable, entertaining game. Get ready for a bonanza of fun \u2013 where laughs never stop!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
